#: ../../source/statut.rst:4
msgid "Statut d'un joueur"
msgstr "Player status"

#: ../../source/statut.rst:20
msgid ""
"La réponse à « est-ce que je joue ? », que le classement ne donne pas : "
"une note situe un joueur, elle ne dit pas s'il a encore un match (voir la"
" note ``section_exit`` dans :ref:`classement`). Le statut est **dérivé** "
"de l'état, comme ``State.Infos`` : il ne dépend que du journal, ni de "
"l'heure ni d'une proposition non confirmée — sauf le repêchage, dont les "
"candidats proposés restent indécis tant que le TD n'a pas tranché. "
"``Statuses`` est vide (``nil``) avant la création du tournoi."
msgstr ""
"The answer to \"am I playing?\", which the standings do not give: a note "
"locates a player, it does not say whether they still have a match (see "
"the ``section_exit`` note in :ref:`classement`). The status is "
"**derived** from the state, like ``State.Infos``: it depends only on the "
"journal, neither on the time nor on an unconfirmed proposal — except the "
"repechage, whose proposed candidates remain undecided until the TD has "
"ruled. ``Statuses`` is empty (``nil``) before the tournament is created."

#: ../../source/statut.rst:26
msgid ""
"``Phase`` est la phase dont parle le statut : en cours (``playing``, "
"``bye``), à venir (``qualified``, ``undecided``), dernière où le joueur "
"est entré (``eliminated``, ``withdrawn``, ``winner``)."
msgstr ""
"``Phase`` is the phase the status is about: the current one (``playing``,"
" ``bye``), an upcoming one (``qualified``, ``undecided``), the last one "
"the player entered (``eliminated``, ``withdrawn``, ``winner``)."

