#: ../../source/statut.rst:101
msgid ""
"Un **repêché** est qualifié dès que le repêchage est confirmé, puisque "
"``rrQualified`` le compte ; le retiré qu'il remplace est ``withdrawn``. "
"Un candidat proposé mais pas confirmé est ``undecided`` ; si le TD passe "
"outre et tire le tableau, le repêchage est clos et le candidat est "
"éliminé. Une poule ne connaît pas d'élimination en cours de phase : ses "
"joueurs sont ``playing`` jusqu'à la fin des poules et des barrages."
msgstr ""
"A **repechaged** player is qualified as soon as the repechage is "
"confirmed, since ``rrQualified`` counts them; the withdrawn player they "
"replace is ``withdrawn``. A candidate who is proposed but not confirmed "
"is ``undecided``; if the TD overrides and draws the bracket, the "
"repechage is closed and the candidate is eliminated. A pool has no "
"elimination during the phase: its players are ``playing`` until the end "
"of the pools and play-offs."

#: ../../source/statut.rst:107
msgid ""
"Le passage simulé est la raison d'être de cette fonction dans le moteur :"
" la liste des qualifiés est celle que ``next_phase`` produira (un test le"
" vérifie à chaque passage de toute la matrice), sans que l'hôte ait à "
"rejouer le journal ni à recoder ``enterFrom``."
msgstr ""
"The simulated switch is the reason this function exists in the engine: "
"the list of qualifiers is the one ``next_phase`` will produce (a test "
"checks this at every switch across the whole matrix), without the host "
"having to replay the journal or recode ``enterFrom``."
